#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:57
msgid "## Architecture patterns"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:80
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart TB\n"
"  subgraph browser [Browser]\n"
"    UI[Satellite UI]\n"
"  end\n"
"  subgraph satelliteProcess [Satellite process]\n"
"    HTTP[HTTP server]\n"
"    HubApi[hub-api proxy]\n"
"    SapClient[SAP client runSapTransport]\n"
"    LocalTools[Local tool handlers]\n"
"  end\n"
"  subgraph hub [Hub]\n"
"    SapWs[\"/sap/v1\"]\n"
"    Runtime[AgentRuntime]\n"
"  end\n"
"  UI --> HTTP\n"
"  HTTP --> HubApi\n"
"  HubApi --> SapClient\n"
"  SapClient --> SapWs\n"
"  SapWs --> Runtime\n"
"  SapClient --> LocalTools\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:82
msgid "### Parlor satellite"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:84
msgid ""
"Browser connects to Hub via SAP WebSocket from the client ([`browser-"
"client.ts`](../../packages/sap-contract/src/browser-client.ts)); static "
"server only serves UI + `/config.json`. No server-side hub-api proxy."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:86
msgid "### Pair-programming satellite"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:88
msgid ""
"HTTP API forwards to SAP RPC; SSE streams map from SAP `stream.*` events. "
"Terminal WebSocket bridges to SAP `terminal.*`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:95
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"sequenceDiagram\n"
"  participant Browser\n"
"  participant HTTP as Satellite HTTP\n"
"  participant SAP as SapClient\n"
"  participant Hub as Hub\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:111
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Browser->>HTTP: POST /api/sessions\n"
"  HTTP->>SAP: request session.create\n"
"  SAP->>Hub: req session.create\n"
"  Hub->>SAP: res session_id\n"
"  SAP->>HTTP: session_id\n"
"  HTTP->>Browser: JSON response\n"
"  Browser->>HTTP: POST /api/messages SSE\n"
"  HTTP->>SAP: request message.send\n"
"  SAP->>Hub: req message.send\n"
"  loop stream events\n"
"    Hub-->>SAP: evt stream.*\n"
"    SAP-->>HTTP: map to SSE\n"
"    HTTP-->>Browser: SSE event\n"
"  end\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

